B.Uk=new A.bx(5,1,"\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f","Dinner with foreign team","C\xf4ng ty t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c b\u1eefa t\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111o\xe0n kh\xe1ch n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\xe0i. M\xecnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1eddi d\u1ef1. Ng\u1ed3i c\u1ea1nh m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi Nh\u1eadt v\xe0 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1ef9. Kh\xf4ng bi\u1ebft n\xf3i g\xec... ch\u1ec9 c\u01b0\u1eddi v\xe0 g\u1eadt \u0111\u1ea7u.",B.a0V,B.XI,B.Vf,"You are an American business visitor at a dinner in Taiwan. Ask me about local food, culture, and my experience working here. Be friendly and conversational.","You accidentally spill food on a foreign guest! Learn to apologize gracefully","\ud83d\ude05")
