B.TC=new A.bx(6,1,"\ud83d\udcca","Presenting data in English","S\u1ebfp y\xeau c\u1ea7u m\xecnh tr\xecnh b\xe0y b\xe1o c\xe1o s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tu\u1ea7n n\xe0y cho kh\xe1ch n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\xe0i. 10 ph\xfat. M\xecnh ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd thuy\u1ebft tr\xecnh b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Anh tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\xe2y.",B.ZD,B.Yn,B.a0n,"You are a foreign manager listening to my production report presentation. Ask clarifying questions about the data and give constructive feedback on my presentation style.","A chart shows unexpected drop in quality! Explain the reason and recovery plan","\ud83d\udcc9")
